{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:00 2026-11-17 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"林俊賢驚揭想追同劇女神拍檔  得知一事後卻步：好彩冇追  女方曾喪子消失幕前\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/deae2ec809c51cea846f596d8099448e/2026-11/20261117_ENT_ENT___0.png\"/>\n<p>65歲的林俊賢早年憑經典劇《唐太宗李世民》紅遍兩岸三地，近日他在社交平台與網民重溫舊片，大方重提昔日拍劇往事，更驚爆當年差點鬧出大烏龍。林俊賢直言飾演女主角「楊吉兒」的內地第一古裝美人傅藝偉是默契十足的「老拍檔」，更坦承當年在戲外曾對她動心、想展開追求，怎料拍完戲後才驚悉對方早已結婚，令他慶幸直呼：「好彩最後沒有追！」如今事過境遷，林俊賢表示如有機會也想再跟傅藝偉合作。</p>\n<h2>林俊賢與前妻曾鬧家暴糾紛</h2>\n<p>雖然這對「最佳螢幕情侶」在戲內襯到絕，但兩人在戲外的情路卻異常崎嶇。林俊賢經歷過兩段婚姻，其女兒為2022年港姐冠軍林鈺洧。林鈺洧自幼隨母親Jasmine生活，Jasmine曾接受訪問，公開力斥林俊賢不負責任，更控訴曾兩度遭他家暴打至臉腫，更曾被要求驗女兒DNA。林俊賢隨後在微博反擊，承認曾有肢體衝突，但辯稱是因對方先動手和實施精神家暴，自己才還手自衛，雙方各執一詞，家醜鬧得沸沸揚揚。</p>\n<img alt=\"久未露面的林俊賢更開金口獻唱《風繼續吹》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14db11be0f28845130f503b4d265134e/2024-10/WhatsApp_Image_2024-10-28_at_13_08_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Naomi （馮鎵瀠）亦現身撐場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24be217d7052d55fddfc28988bbf4c18/2024-10/Naomi_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林俊賢坦言近年在內地都係做自己高興的事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1e850e8dd549abb8361905ff1fbb8ac/2024-10/WhatsApp_Image_2024-10-28_at_13_08_46.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林俊賢與女兒林鈺洧見面，共享天倫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9de8d53d0170872c3d5fe94dd542e421/2024-10/8c9d5d63-6e01-4f70-9e6f-02e7605f36ed.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現年62歲的傅藝偉保養得宜，曾被封「最美妲己」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f08c46f58dfe682f824105bf7a4d7e53/2026-11/4cb34ef3gw1eywx9j144ej20dc0hsabr.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"傅藝偉當年的高顏值不輸林青霞，可惜現實中兩度離婚，命運弄人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92e674fb469260a928d1ddae9304b701/2026-11/4cb34ef3jw1ezqva700wnj20qo0zkjwu.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"傅藝偉與獨子高樂男。高樂男於2023年不幸因病離世，令她痛失摯愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/548767b264a30c653b2425d51eaa3868/2026-11/4cb34ef3jw1f41p0tixb4j20a80aydg6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧是2022年港姐冠軍，但自小與父親甚少見面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc16cea1e222457446cb9e7667e93d16/2026-11/A006.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林俊賢有份主演的電影《風林火山》即將上映，他透露當初一位監製致電說麥浚龍想找他拍戲，飾演鬼叔一角，能與好多影帝合作感高興。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0de1ab6178f28fb2016d4e2802c61da/2024-10/173029389928958.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧童年與母親Jasmine相依為命。Jasmine年前曾公開力斥林俊賢\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5e4ec8720624404940f6067466184ca/2026-11/Dencie_Jasmine.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧與林俊賢近期已較少合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbca3b8ec636d50d540affb73d615fe9/2022-12/LAMD9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧是昔日小生林俊賢（右）的女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18b4b1da588af9356be5fb142cd87f2c/2024-06/111_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧選港姐時爆出不少是非。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23f70eeeb6778dc44980139e29657355/2023-08/denice_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧是2022年港姐冠軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f8c5d31051f06586bb6ba40ee7116ec6/2022-12/LAMD4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧（右二）當選後不斷被匿名人士爆料。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a1276c0b475496d13f080a3e4977d1b9/2022-12/LAMD5.jpg\"/>\n<h2>林俊賢最佳女拍檔吸毒喪子</h2>\n<p>林俊賢大讚默契十足的傅藝偉，曾憑《封神榜》被封「最美妲己」，現年62歲的她經歷兩度婚姻失敗，在事業下滑與打擊下於2016年涉嫌吸毒被捕，自此淡出大眾視線。更痛心的是，2023年突傳出其獨子高樂男病逝的噩耗，令痛失摯愛的她徹底消聲匿跡，告別娛樂圈，林俊賢要跟她再次合作，相信不是易事。</p>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧曾在ViuTV節目《對號入座》中大談性史。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b6fb2da8ac2620c4afce27b0be5df23/2023-08/D2_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指因她的形象與慧妍雅集不符而無法加入。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c5a942e47c3b6d85b14e31bffde4a1e/2023-08/VS--YouTube--2_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧當選後有不停轉變形象，與邢慧敏出席慈善晚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e3b0c38b058ace72b5bc85807bd085f8/2023-07/003_34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧的身份可媲美「港版羅拉」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76640231abe7212b5b941eb438bb4e92/2026-05/denicelams_1778494449_3894611744895159568_1974277159_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧揸住建造業牌照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/205d3018d224684fa155638511287e59/2026-05/denicelams_1778494449_3894611756706314696_1974277159_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧曾自己搞慈善活動，相約朋友到沙灘執垃圾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4474e16c0cf8069c070e9e23116dd3e0/2023-02/Screenshot_20230129_024736_com.instagram.android.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧、梁允瑜、鄭衍峰、孔德賢與徐榮到大埔拍攝《不可能的任務》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d37aa7f3ed82d78b1679e6e65e16f962/2023-07/KakaoTalk_20230719_131622818_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧曾分享噴血泳衣照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8b44879c4d76f1a6a75533b43bc99b1/2023-05/DENICE_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧曾分享噴血泳衣照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15ec6808fcc57bb5220ab2415614f52d/2023-05/DENICE_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧身材Fit爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26de23399125f4ab158b90f3169631ea/2023-05/DENICE_05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧的棗紅色Deep V一件頭也曾出現過。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c4bd9d64ab6a0981015c405c61fe6e2/2023-05/DENICE_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧即使躺臥在駕駛座上，一雙D Cup巨咪仍堅挺無比。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8c0994a2d0f240a778ebb02fd6adc23/2023-05/KAYEE_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧一雙43吋長腿好吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f87453e4ae05df24a269e9759d6dd24b/2023-05/KAYEE_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧在雪地騷火辣身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0cd17a4c07f30f8f2bc36dd71db5903/2024-03/denicelams_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧在雪地騷火辣身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb2c4b6a7db2a4588854e541ee966fe2/2024-03/denicelams_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧與馬清揚曾被捕獲在中上環一間日式餐廳用膳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b3e31b85fea2bfd31876607924498141/2024-06/WhatsApp_Image_2024-06-17_at_20_11_44_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧曾被指與譚嘉儀（左）、2020年港姐亞軍陳楨怡出席「富豪飯局」，為爭取發展機會落力施冧功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2fc2ab7fc164517ab4f310eaad37a7c4/2024-03/LAM_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消息傳出後，林鈺洧（右）火速於IG發文澄清，只是跟慈善團體人士食飯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e4f4b38305c5a6ad676d1e20cd83361/2024-03/LAM_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧兩年前加入處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7c082e37eebc67817e2407c6af62678/2026-02/denice_47.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧在《愛．回家之開心速遞》飾演「接龍初戀Cafe」侍應。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/273480a3e3c78f00ccb39b5c1d82d9dc/2024-05/DENISE_11a.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧從蝸居搬到豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2721296859bcd05bcda7bb570d4b3eb/2026-02/denice_45.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧最近到杜拜旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4befb453ccae2b8a6169ff0b0410534/2026-02/denice_43.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧坐商務艙豪遊杜拜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc96e88c8d208b01fdcbf772630f75bd/2026-02/denice_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧開箱曝光隨身攜帶的物品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68418e44f194ff52bffc5e0da1661740/2026-02/denice_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧帶面膜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7dd723b315a1665afe0cb97a9fabcd5c/2026-02/denice_17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧搽「阿婆香水」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56dce3e77052c8096aae15ef2e144cb6/2026-02/denice_22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧袋住平安符。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b443632eb0bbd084a5b76a2078f4174e/2026-02/denice_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧買新相機去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/242f658e8ba811454f822f9f8aa78636/2026-02/denice_24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧仲有帶紙巾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84bf297373fa453d44301a4b8a5bc1ef/2026-02/denice_26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧第一次在杜拜跳傘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cc4dace0ca376ef008b029bf8fda279/2026-02/denice_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧未準備跳傘前心情好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af60f0df15abce0e74717408a1f0c7bc/2026-02/denice_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧神情緊張。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be1a6ec9c81062d261149a98e79e2021/2026-02/denice_30.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧由教練幫忙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/374993a943939dbb49cf5e791047e767/2026-02/denice_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧學習中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/327be50f505decd51381aedc8858be52/2026-02/denice_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧出發前打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ce93c1b958dd56fa2105b0b644518ad/2026-02/denice_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧表情扭曲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6761542c7c469f1cf9d4167d3e62744b/2026-02/denice_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧素顏上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11ed764e2b5f7281243d24ee89c5efdc/2026-02/denice_40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧全程未見放鬆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c32919274520e04433d39b3490e6585e/2026-02/denice_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧在杜拜嘗試高空跳傘體驗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64ebdd945853855dc19743e0b7739bdf/2026-02/denice_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧表示從來沒有想像過會去跳傘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56fe5c2beaf5f79a7d87fd0539466398/2026-02/denice_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧大讚：「杜拜實在太美。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0405fee64f0e9caa224a4d6c3cedba8d/2026-02/denice_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧表示整個過程沒有想像中恐怖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d96d8d3b2efb0936a344fe54aedd807/2026-02/denice_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧曾晒性感照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0223567f77dc14099a70aa1b02b83c66/2025-10/1_9_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧中門大開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88e3ce519f19b84757eb1b3ef9c69ace/2025-10/2_11_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧甫士好誘惑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8700f8652e6fc015331356c2ebfc07b6/2025-10/3_8_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧表情嫵媚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9fe1f6c1dd82d648d4233231a1ab9d9/2025-10/4_8_49.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧騷「絕對領域」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/892a16a04d6a5f8d9737488b1e27c44c/2025-10/5_8_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林鈺洧西裝褸內僅穿內衣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/986bbe5363acd49382e66cd76a0635de/2025-10/7_5_11.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:51:52.200887+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":575,"images":64,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:00:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:54.168483+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:45:24.091579+00:00","content_hash":"b79a94fa5e6beb41cd9cac45ad0f44072de9c41836d42b5090e59e325a6d23a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}